	(text "Scope test points (loop, takes a scope hook). TP1 = U1 DI (TX data), TP2 = U1 RO (RX data), TP3 = U2 DI (TX clock),\nTP4 = U2 RO (RX clock): the 3.3 V logic side of the MAX3490. TP5 and TP6 = ground for the scope clip. TP7 = 3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150.00 316.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16136f78-e7a5-420b-8c9b-1b251763fedb")
	)
	(text "HDLC-ESP32-S2: WEMOS S2 mini + 2 x MAX3490E, male DB-25 straight into the ND (ND manual pin numbers)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.00 20.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.00 2.00)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e20a78af-bcea-4b4b-9ad1-d90371c9f8b5")
	)
	(text "Nets ND<n>_... use the ND's own pin numbers. TX (board to ND) = Y/Z outputs on 16/4 and 18/6. RX (ND to board) = A/B inputs on 14/2 and 15/3.\nPower: USB cable to the S2 mini; its 3V3 pin feeds both chips (the S2 mini's own regulator, current NOT checked). VBUS pin not used.\nESP pins (2026-11-08 handoff): TX data GPIO11, TX clock GPIO7, RX data GPIO9, RX clock GPIO12. The S2 mini schematic confirms these are on header J2 (3V3 is J2 pin 8).\nJ1 footprint is EMPTY on purpose: choose it only after checking a real connector against db25-footprint-check.pdf.\nNot included: 120 ohm termination, surge protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.00 32.00 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7adedf43-77b0-4bb9-8630-feb4d0e3f371")
	)
	(sheet_instances
		(path "/"
			(page "1")
		)
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
